    <div class="note mt-2">
      <strong>Planning default:</strong> quote 24 days port-to-port, plan the stock around 30–38.
      Ask the forwarder to split port-to-port and door dates so the ocean leg is not mistaken for
      the delivery promise. For Kuwait the tax is small enough that schedule reliability is the
      thing to pay for — a slightly pricier service that sails on time usually beats a cheap window
      that does not.
    </div>
  </section>

