  <section class="section container">
    <h2>9. After the border: the fee stack, demurrage and detention</h2>
    <p>
      The 5% duty is the only quantified statutory line in Kuwait; every operational fee below
      it was not published in the verified snapshot. That is not a reason to skip the line — it
      is a reason to make the provider itemise it. Ask for each component in writing, with the
      currency and the trigger, before comparing providers.
    </p>

    <DataTable
      columns={[
